{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"よう(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうじき秋ですよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読書の秋\n芸術の秋\nスポーツの秋\n食欲の秋"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○○の秋ってよく言うけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、これありすぎだよね\n結局はなんでもいいんだよね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この際なにか作ろう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり中田は\n『ヲタ活の秋』にしよう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋ってか年中だった(゜ロ゜)ぺろぺろ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アメブロの方のコメントも読んでくれるの？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n読んでるよ！まだ途中までだけど＞＜\n全部読む〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"573の写メなんで反転してるの？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n寝転んで上から撮ってるからだよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいのケチャップアートで\n「いただきまーす！」って言ってるのは\n中田？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nそうです`・ω・´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は\n「氣志團万博2013」のレッスンだったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれるかたいますか〜？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/09/11/0984189/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/09/11/0984189/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}